    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GWD Estates are delighted to present to the Clonshaugh property market this extended four bedroom property for sale. This charming property is positioned in a mature and quiet cul-de-sac in a very desirable part of Clonshaugh.\r\n30 Newbury Grove is a property that will appeal to a variety of buyers as its owner occupied and has never been rented.\r\nThe location is so close to a wide selection of both primary & Secondary schools and sporting facilities.  Northside Shopping Centre, Clarehall Shopping centre and Artaine Castle Shopping centre are all conveniently located. Beaumont hospital is also within a very short drive. There are numerous bus routes just a stroll away making access to the city centre easy and both the M50 and M1 are minutes away as is Dublin Airport.\r\nAccommodation: Extended entrance hallway with wooden floors, sitting room with wooden floors and fireplace, Large kitchen cum dining room with floor and wall presses and ceramic floor tiles, downstairs custom built bedroom with wooden floors and built in wardrobes and bathroom. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and a bathroom. The property has d/g Pvc windows to the front and has been rewired. The back area is a courtyard style, is private and is 35ft long and the front garden has a drive in.\r\n\r\nAll in all, this is a fantastic property set in a brilliant location in a much sought after area of Clonshaugh and viewing of this property is strongly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway: 16'2'' x 5;8;; wooden floors with under stairs storage.\r\n\r\nSitting room: 14'8''x 9'5'' Wooden floors with open fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen cum dining room: 15'10'' x 12'3'' Floor and wall presses with ceramic floor and wall tiles.\r\n\r\nDownstairs bedroom 4: 13'5'' x 9'11'' Built in wardrobes with wooden floors and patio door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nDownstairs bathroom: 7'8'' x 6'2'' custom built wet room with shower, toilet and sink with ceramic floor and wall tiles.\r\n\r\nLanding: Carpet with hot-press.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 14'0'' x 9'10'' Carpet with wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 13'2'' x 9'10'' Wooden floors.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 8'0'' x 7'11'' Wooden floors.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 8'2'' x 5'2'' Walk in shower, toilet and sink with ceramic tiles."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extended property\r\nFourth bedroom custom built downstairs\r\nTwo bathrooms\r\nRewired\r\nD/g Pvc windows\r\nDrive in to front\r\nQuiet cul de sac location"
      },
      {
